TWO-BLOCK ADVERSARIAL CAULDRONS S620

Schedule residue filters mod 4
- parity alternation: A,B,A,B,... (pure odd/even attack streams)
  A stream (1, 3): pair sums (0, 2), self-hit (), pair-missing (1, 3), 2/3-term closure (0, 1, 2, 3)
  B stream (0, 2): pair sums (0, 2), self-hit (0, 2), pair-missing (), 2/3-term closure (0, 2)
- one-handicap two-block: A,B,B,A,A,B,B,... (period-four square wave with a one-move A start)
  A stream (0, 1): pair sums (0, 1, 2), self-hit (0, 1), pair-missing (), 2/3-term closure (0, 1, 2, 3)
  B stream (2, 3): pair sums (0, 1, 2), self-hit (2,), pair-missing (3,), 2/3-term closure (0, 1, 2, 3)
- strict two-block: A,A,B,B,A,A,B,B,... (same period-four square wave without the first-turn handicap)
  A stream (1, 2): pair sums (0, 2, 3), self-hit (2,), pair-missing (1,), 2/3-term closure (0, 1, 2, 3)
  B stream (0, 3): pair sums (0, 2, 3), self-hit (0, 3), pair-missing (), 2/3-term closure (0, 1, 2, 3)

